{"translation":{"id":"shr_buk","name":"BIBLIYA NTAGATIFU OMU MASHI","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=shr","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=shr","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"BUK","englishName":"Mashi Bible","language":"shr","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"d0acf3ec89bc33a67f59fef818d8d76884367403c5ab68c444f56c0ab7124b5c","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/shr_buk/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1192,"totalNumberOfVerses":31343,"languageName":"Shi","languageEnglishName":"Shi","numberOfApocryphalBooks":7,"totalNumberOfApocryphalChapters":137,"totalNumberOfApocryphalVerses":4110},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"shr_buk","name":"Lulanga lwa","commonName":"Lulanga lwa","title":"ENNANGA","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"55483bb8496ed45725d6db8a2627586120d55889da252080a0aa75f3b09c956f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/shr_buk/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/shr_buk/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2515},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["lralà ly’okuj’omu ka-Nyamuzinda"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Ontwîre olubanja, Nnâmahanga, ondêrhere nyâze eyo mihera, onandîkûzekwo erya ndyâlya y’ecishungu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Bulya Nnâmahanga, we buzibu bwâni; cirhumire wanyôza? Cirhumire nciyumva ogu mutula gw’akushimbwa n’omubisha?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Orhume obumoleke bwâwe n’oburhabêsha bwâwe, byo byandusa bìnyêrek’enjira, byo byampisa oku ntondo yâwe ntagatîfu n’omu birâlo byâwe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Njâge aha ìbuye lya Nyamuzinda obwo aha burhambi bwa Nyamuzinda orhuma nasîma nanshagaluke. Nkuzagye Nyamuzinda obwo, mmanule olulanga nkuzemwo Nyamuzinda wâni.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Murhima gwâni, carhuma warhoga? Carhuma wandwîrira omu nda? Cîkubagire Nnâmahanga: niono nkola nashub’imukuza, ye bucire bw’obusù bwâni, ye na Nyamuzinda wâni.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/shr_buk/PSA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/shr_buk/PSA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/shr_buk/PSA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}